{"id":"104f4015953e8c39","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Banach Mazur Game","display":"df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game — ZFC Game2 Banach Mazur Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game — ZFC Game2 Banach Mazur Game","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-game.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-banach-mazur-game — ZFC Game2 Banach Mazur Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-game.md\">../batch02/58-df-game.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (target set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\\)</span> (legal-position tree defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_A\">\\(W_A\\)</span> (winning-play set for player I defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{turn}_{BM}\">\\(\\operatorname{turn}_{BM}\\)</span> (player-to-move function defined below; players are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,II\">\\(I,II\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (game tuple)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BanachMazurGame}\">\\(\\operatorname{BanachMazurGame}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}legal} \\vdash \\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{s\\in(\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;s(j)\\subseteq s(i)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}legal} \\vdash \\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{s\\in(\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;s(j)\\subseteq s(i)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}turn} \\vdash \\operatorname{turn}_{BM}\\in\\{I,II\\}^{\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}}\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{turn}_{BM}(s)=I\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{lh}(s)=2k)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}turn} \\vdash \\operatorname{turn}_{BM}\\in\\{I,II\\}^{\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}}\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{turn}_{BM}(s)=I\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{lh}(s)=2k)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}winning} \\vdash W_A\\coloneqq\\left\\{u\\in(\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})^\\omega:\\left(\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\omega\\;u(j)\\subseteq u(i)\\right)\\land A\\cap\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)\\neq\\varnothing\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}winning} \\vdash W_A\\coloneqq\\left\\{u\\in(\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})^\\omega:\\left(\\forall i&lt;j&lt;\\omega\\;u(j)\\subseteq u(i)\\right)\\land A\\cap\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)\\neq\\varnothing\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\operatorname{BanachMazurGame}(G,X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land G=\\langle\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau},\\operatorname{turn}_{BM},W_A\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}game} \\vdash \\operatorname{BanachMazurGame}(G,X,\\tau,A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land G=\\langle\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau},\\operatorname{turn}_{BM},W_A\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Players alternately choose decreasing nonempty open sets. Under the convention used here, player I wins exactly when their intersection meets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-game.md","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-game.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"W_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{turn}_{BM}","display":false},{"tex":"I,II","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BanachMazurGame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}legal} \\vdash \\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\left\\{s\\in(\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})^{<\\omega}:\\forall i<j<\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;s(j)\\subseteq s(i)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}turn} \\vdash \\operatorname{turn}_{BM}\\in\\{I,II\\}^{\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}}\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathcal L_{X,\\tau}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{turn}_{BM}(s)=I\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{lh}(s)=2k)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}banach\\text{-}mazur\\text{-}winning} \\vdash W_A\\coloneqq\\left\\{u\\in(\\tau\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\})^\\omega:\\left(\\forall i<j<\\omega\\;u(j)\\subseteq u(i)\\right)\\land A\\cap\\bigcap_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)\\neq\\varnothing\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}b